{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03C190","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"跟武装直升机正面硬拼，几条命都不够用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不过在这种地方，游击战术很有效。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不断从一棵树的掩护转移到另一棵树，从空中就很难掌握你的位置。这就是取胜的机会。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不愧是<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>。真是身经百战。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"别这么说，Boss。另外，也要注意声音。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"躲在掩体后面时，我们这边也很难观察对方的情况。所以根据声音判断对方的位置就很重要。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"还有，如果可以的话，最好瞄准尾桨。光是这样就能大幅降低直升机的机动性。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"也要小心地面部队。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"了解，<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}